# Camino Validator Status Monitor Cron Example
# Run the monitor once every minute.
#
# To install:
# 1. Open your cron table with the command:
#    crontab -e
#
# 2. Paste the line below at the bottom of your crontab and save:
#    * * * * * /path/to/camino-val-status-alarm/monitor_validators.py --force
#
# Note: Ensure the script path matches your actual installation folder.
